{"sections":[{"slug":"凝聚态数学","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"凝聚态数学"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚态数学</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">学科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"凝聚态数学"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"学科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">凝聚态数学的很多结论就是当年做硬分析的人做的</span>.</p>\n<p>Clausen-Scholze <span lang=\"zh\">在非</span> Archimedes <span lang=\"zh\">语境下定义了</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/pro-有限集","text":"pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限集</span>"}},{"Plain":" $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上自由</span> $\\mathbb Z$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $\\underline{\\mathbb Z[S]}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的某种完备化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为固态化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">而在</span> Archimedes <span lang=\"zh\">的语境</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">液态性</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">又称为分析结构</span>, analytic structure) <span lang=\"zh\">是某种完备性</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这与泛函分析中的完备张量积有关</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">基本概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚态集合","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚态集合</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}